Z||000012||Songman||04-04-2001||10:40 PM||||Cliff,<P>Maybe you can check these... I hate to keep uploading the same file to your server trying to get it to work... <P>Each time it showed to upload successfully but will not show when posted. It used to be possible to view the contents of the upload folder on your server to verify that a file was there. That is no longer available.<P>Josh...<P>I'll e-mail the file to you directly and if you have some webspace somewhere you can host it there to post in your sig...<P>Let me know if you want something else...<P>My7Fieros...<P>Contact me if you need any help. Us TN boys gotta stick together! Still hoping to get all of us together soon!<P>Dale<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
